export anchor DataLakeStyle:
    number: 408
    screen: DatabaseConsole
    name: Data lake
    idea: The console reads from the surface down, with each part of the screen a deeper and darker band of water, so status floats at the waterline, tables bob as buoys, results hang as plumb lines and history settles as sediment.
    base: dark
    palette:
        sky: #0a2236, the top bar above the waves
        depth0: #11506f, the surface band and the wave strip
        depth1: #0d3d5c, the shallows band
        depth2: #0a2e49, the mid water band
        depth3: #071f36, the deep band
        depth4: #041322, the lake floor, the page and the style sheet
        glass: #0f3552, table buoys and fields
        ink: #eef8ff, text
        muted: #b3d6ea, depth labels, column types and meta
        aqua: #74e4ff, band headings, plumb weights, the primary button and focus
        onAqua: #032434, text on aqua
        sand: #e7c98e, history times and string literals
        ok: #8ce8b4, Done
        bad: #ffa092, Failed and its error
    type:
        Humanist sans, Avenir Next, Avenir, Nunito Sans, Segoe UI. Base 15px
        at 1.55. The app name is 20px at 600, depth figures 22px at 600,
        band headings 13px bold caps at 0.14em, result weights 24px bold.
        SQL and columns use ui-monospace at 13 to 14px.
    layout:
        A top bar with an aqua drop mark, Brightwork Data and Connected to
        production-replica ends in a full width wave strip. Below, five
        full width bands each have a 112px depth rail on the left with a
        dashed edge, reading 0 m Surface, 10 m Shallows, 40 m Mid water,
        120 m Deep and 200 m Lake floor. The surface band shows three round
        pills, a padlock Read-only replica, a wave Lag 2 seconds and linked
        rings 14 active connections. The shallows show tables as round
        buoys, with tasks opened into a glowing card listing its six
        columns down a left aqua line. Mid water holds a 20px rounded query
        panel with lower case SQL and a bar with Cast query, Save and a note
        that the replica is read-only. Deep shows three plumb lines from a
        ruled waterline, each ending in an aqua drop with the count, the
        Billing migration line twice as long, captions under each, and a
        sentence explaining that deeper means more. The floor shows history
        as three stacked sediment strips with sand times, the failed strip
        reddish with a diamond cross icon and the error line. Below 720px
        the depth rail becomes an inline label above each band.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px band padding, 12px to 16px between items.
    density: Low. One idea per band, read top to bottom.
    corners: Round. 20px panels and buoys, full round pills and buttons, drop shaped weights, 16px sediment block.
    borders: Thin translucent pale blue lines, the open table in solid aqua, a dashed depth rail.
    shadows: A soft aqua glow around the open table only.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 16px. Padlock, wave and rings for status,
        ring with tick for Done, diamond with cross for Failed, each with
        its word.
    focus: A 3px aqua outline offset 3px, following the round shapes.
    tone: Calm water words, such as Cast query, Soundings, Sediment and Waterline.
